# this test can simply stat: `NativeLoader.jsResolve` asks `require.resolve` for
# `@kyo/ffi-native/native/<os>-<arch>/lib<id>.<ext>`. So Node is the judge here, resolving that exact specifier from
# the linked output's directory, the way the application does.
